{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control without control.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Servo</strong> is a sci-fi action puzzle game where control is all about momentum. Instead of moving the drone like in a traditional platformer, you propel it forward using carefully timed <strong>speed boosts</strong> and <strong>gravity shifts</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed boost</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give an impulse and ricochet through the environment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/07e1b68257ef08aafbcc5619094a8cb5.poster.avif?t=1773738655\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/07e1b68257ef08aafbcc5619094a8cb5.webm?t=1773738655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/07e1b68257ef08aafbcc5619094a8cb5.mp4?t=1773738655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reverse gravity </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why jump if you can just flip the gravity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/0d460497222676c1d9e21164f0e5d10c.poster.avif?t=1773738655\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/0d460497222676c1d9e21164f0e5d10c.webm?t=1773738655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/0d460497222676c1d9e21164f0e5d10c.mp4?t=1773738655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is fractured\u2014glitching structures, impossible geometry, and shifting hazards stand between you and the exit. Every level challenges you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time your boosts</strong> to launch the drone across gaps, walls, and hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip gravity</strong> to reorient the world and open new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain movement together</strong> for smooth, precise runs through broken landscapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t steer the drone\u2014you <i>influence its motion</i>. The better your timing and creativity, the more fluidly you\u2019ll navigate the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078500?t=1773738655","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078500?t=1773738655","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/f1422b4048fff4c52e95fc94e270ac7ef27efd48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773738655","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/f1422b4048fff4c52e95fc94e270ac7ef27efd48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773738655","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control without control.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Servo</strong> is a sci-fi action puzzle game where control is all about momentum. Instead of moving the drone like in a traditional platformer, you propel it forward using carefully timed <strong>speed boosts</strong> and <strong>gravity shifts</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed boost</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give an impulse and ricochet through the environment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/07e1b68257ef08aafbcc5619094a8cb5.poster.avif?t=1773738655\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/07e1b68257ef08aafbcc5619094a8cb5.webm?t=1773738655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/07e1b68257ef08aafbcc5619094a8cb5.mp4?t=1773738655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reverse gravity </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why jump if you can just flip the gravity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/0d460497222676c1d9e21164f0e5d10c.poster.avif?t=1773738655\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/0d460497222676c1d9e21164f0e5d10c.webm?t=1773738655\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/extras/0d460497222676c1d9e21164f0e5d10c.mp4?t=1773738655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is fractured\u2014glitching structures, impossible geometry, and shifting hazards stand between you and the exit. Every level challenges you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time your boosts</strong> to launch the drone across gaps, walls, and hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip gravity</strong> to reorient the world and open new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain movement together</strong> for smooth, precise runs through broken landscapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t steer the drone\u2014you <i>influence its motion</i>. The better your timing and creativity, the more fluidly you\u2019ll navigate the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Steven Delrue"],"dlc":[4079580],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078500/f340ec8400a3d27497f9d952e651f185f92a60ef/header.jpg?t=1773738655","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal graphics Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078500/370734558/44b8589a78bb1e536f3df98f36909c36215de136/1762458663/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762957072","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078500/370734558/44b8589a78bb1e536f3df98f36909c36215de136/1762458663/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762957072","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078500/370734558/44b8589a78bb1e536f3df98f36909c36215de136/1762458663/hls_264_master